OL,3,A'Stain on the country': Trump
OL,4,Acriticises Norway over Nobel Peace
OL,5,APrize
OL,6,
OL,7,FTrump has been outspoken about his
OL,8,Fdesire to win the prize, and made
OL,9,Fsimilar criticisms in 2025 when it was
OL,10,Fawarded to Venezuelan opposition leader
OL,11,FMaria Corina Machado.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
